 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "start and end are weekly times written \"Day H:MM AM\" or \"Day H:MM PM\": Day is one of Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat Sun, H is 1 to 12 without a leading zero, MM is two digits; 12:MM AM is just after midnight and 12:MM PM just after noon. The week runs Mon to Sun. Return, in chronological order and in the same format, every time t from start to end inclusive whose minute is a multiple of 5. When end is earlier in the week than start, the range wraps from Sun into the following Mon.",
